/span><span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"st0\">\" code points<span class=\"es1\">\\n</span>\"</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n<span class=\"br0\">}</span>\n&nbsp;\n<span class=\"kw4\">int</span> main<span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span>\n<span class=\"br0\">{</span>\n    <a href=\"/w/cpp/string/basic_string\"><span class=\"kw1238\">std::<span class=\"me2\">string</span></span></a> cppstr <span class=\"sy1\">=</span> <span class=\"st0\">\"ラーメン\"</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>   <span class=\"co1\">// narrow string</span>\n    <a href=\"/w/cpp/string/basic_string\"><span class=\"kw1240\">std::<span class=\"me2\">wstring</span></span></a> wcstr <span class=\"sy1\">=</span> L<span class=\"st0\">\"ラーメン\"</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>  <span class=\"co1\">// wide string</span>\n&nbsp;\n    <span class=\"co1\">// Implicit conversion from string to string_view</span>\n    <span class=\"co1\">// via std::string::operator string_view:</span>\n    <a href=\"/w/cpp/string/basic_string_view\"><span class=\"kw1256\">std::<span class=\"me2\">string_view</span></span></a> cppstr_v <span class=\"sy1\">=</span> cppstr<span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n&nbsp;\n    <a href=\"/w/cpp/io/cout\"><span class=\"kw1775\">std::<span class=\"me2\">cout</span></span></a> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> cppstr_v <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"st0\">'<span class=\"es1\">\\n</span>'</span>\n              <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> cppstr_v.<span class=\"me1\">size</span><span class=\"br0\">(</span><span class=\"br0\">)</span> <span class=\"sy1\">&lt;&lt;</span> <span class=\"st0\">\" code units<span class=\"es1\">\\n</span>\"</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n&nbsp;\n    <span class=\"co1\">// Implicit conversion from wstring to wstring_view</span>\n    <span class=\"co1\">// via std::wstring::operator wstring_view:</span>\n    show_wstring_size<span class=\"br0\">(</span>wcstr<span class=\"br0\">)</span><span class=\"sy4\">;</span>\n<span class=\"br0\">}</span></code></pre>\n<p>Output:\n</p>\n<pre data-output=\"1\"><code>ラーメン\n12 code units\n4 code points</code></pre> \n</div>\n<h3 id=\"See_also\">See also</h3>\n<table class=\"t-dsc-begin\">\n<tr class=\"t-dsc\">\n<td>  <div class=\"t-dsc-member-div t-dsc-member-nobold-div\"><div><a href=\"/w/cpp/string/basic_string_view/basic_string_view\"> <span class=\"t-lines\"><span>(constructor)</span></span></a></div></div>\n</td>\n<td>  constructs a <code>basic_string_view</code> <br> <span class=\"t-mark\">(public member function of <code>std::basic_string_view&lt;CharT,Traits&gt;</code>)</span> </td></tr>\n</table>","headings":[{"depth":3,"text":"Parameters","id":"Parameters"},{"depth":3,"text":"Return value","id":"Return_value"},{"depth":3,"text":"Notes","id":"Notes"},{"depth":3,"text":"Example","id":"Example"},{"depth":3,"text":"See also","id":"See_also"}],"breadcrumbs":[{"path":"","title":"C++ reference"},{"path":"string","title":"Strings library"},{"path":"string/basic_string","title":"std::basic_string"}],"children":[],"map":{"label":"std::basic_string<CharT,Traits,Allocator>::operator basic_string_view","children":[{"label":"Declarations","note":"1 declaration; revisions: since C++17. Returns a std::basic_string_view, constructed as if by std::basic_string_view<CharT, Traits>(data(), size())."},{"label":"Parameters","note":"(none)"},{"label":"Return value","note":"A string view representing the entire contents of the string."},{"label":"Notes","note":"It is the programmer's responsibility to ensure that the resulting string view does not outlive the string."},{"label":"Example"},{"label":"See also","children":[{"label":"(constructor)","note":"constructs a basic_string_view"}]}]},"standards":["C++17","C++20"],"wordCount":167,"codeBlockCount":3}
